// args: --compile
// A loop whose body always aborts (it writes x[0] of an empty array) crashed
// the HQIR generator and the checker: the write is lowered to a with whose
// transformation reads x[0], of type ⊥, but the with was typed 𝟙 regardless,
// so the branch was taken to continue and its variables were merged.
// (Found by fuzzing.)
def main(){
	x:=[];
	while x.length=0|x[0]<2{ x[0]=1 }
	return x;
}
